        {
          "items": [
            "Nestled in the heart of SanDestin (Laurel Grove) , this 3-bedroom vacation home offers a tranquil escape for your next getaway. Imagine waking up to stunning water views and spending your days soaking up the sun by the outdoor pool or relaxing in the soothing hot tub. With free Wi-Fi and a smart TV with cable channels, you can stay connected or unwind with your favorite shows. The fully stocked kitchen, complete with a stove, oven, refrigerator, and all the necessary appliances, makes it easy to prepare delicious meals. Enjoy dining together at the spacious table, or fire up the grill for an alfresco feast. When it's time to explore, you're just a short 6-minute drive from The Links and an 8-minute drive from the beautiful Miramar Beach. For a day of adventure, venture to the nearby Destin Beaches, Sandestin Golf Resort, Burnt Pine, or Baytowne, all within a 5 minute drive. With essentials like air conditioning, heating, and a fitness room, as well as thoughtful touches like a baby gate and games for the kids, this vacation home has everything you need for a comfortable and memorable stay.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
